# src/apps/daemon/internal/platform/plugin

## Purpose
Provides daemon platform integration for plugin lifecycle and host-facing plugin operations.

## Contents
Contains Go plugin adapters, lifecycle helpers, and platform boundary code used to load, invoke, or supervise supported extensions.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Consumed by daemon runtime/orchestration and depends on plugin contracts plus operating-system facilities appropriate to the active platform.

## Invariants
Plugin inputs and capabilities are validated, failures remain isolated from host state, lifecycle ownership is explicit, and privileged/system mutation cannot occur outside approved platform boundaries.